ent-LavalandResonator = resonator
    .desc = A handheld tool that creates resonance fields which crush rock and ore.

ent-LavalandResonatorUpgraded = upgraded resonator
    .desc = An improved resonator with a larger field limit and a matrix mode that turns fields into traps.

ent-LavalandResonanceField = resonance field
    .desc = A humming field of resonating energy.

ent-PKAUpgradeCooldown = PKA modkit (cooldown)
    .desc = A modkit for a proto-kinetic accelerator. Improves its recharge speed.

ent-PKAUpgradeMiningExplosion = PKA modkit (mining explosion)
    .desc = A modkit for a proto-kinetic accelerator. Its bolts drill a small area of rock around the impact.

ent-PKAUpgradeOffensiveExplosion = PKA modkit (offensive explosion)
    .desc = A modkit for a proto-kinetic accelerator. Its bolts burst and damage nearby creatures.

ent-PKAUpgradeOffensiveMiningExplosion = PKA modkit (offensive mining explosion)
    .desc = A modkit for a proto-kinetic accelerator. Its bolts drill rock and damage creatures around the impact.

ent-PKAUpgradeRepeater = PKA modkit (rapid repeater)
    .desc = A modkit for a proto-kinetic accelerator. Slower to recharge, but hits restore most of the cooldown.

ent-PKAUpgradeInfernalRepeater = PKA modkit (infernal repeater)
    .desc = A cursed modkit for a proto-kinetic accelerator. Very slow to recharge, but hits restore the cooldown.

ent-PKAUpgradeLifesteal = PKA modkit (lifesteal)
    .desc = A modkit for a proto-kinetic accelerator. Heals its user for a share of the damage it deals.

ent-PKAUpgradeResonatorBlast = PKA modkit (resonator blast)
    .desc = A modkit for a proto-kinetic accelerator. Its bolts leave a short lived resonance field at the impact.

ent-PKAUpgradeDeathSyphon = PKA modkit (death syphon)
    .desc = A modkit for a proto-kinetic accelerator. Kills with it permanently increase its damage.

ent-PKAUpgradeHumanPassthrough = PKA modkit (human passthrough)
    .desc = A modkit for a proto-kinetic accelerator. Its bolts pass through people without hitting them.

ent-PKAUpgradeSuperChassis = PKA modkit (super chassis)
    .desc = A modkit for a proto-kinetic accelerator. Gives it a bright yellow glow.

ent-PKAUpgradeHyperChassis = PKA modkit (hyper chassis)
    .desc = A modkit for a proto-kinetic accelerator. Gives it a bright orange glow.

ent-PKAUpgradeTracer = PKA modkit (tracer bolts)
    .desc = A modkit for a proto-kinetic accelerator. Makes its bolts shine brightly in flight.

